 (rc msg)←SendMail_PublishedPkg(INI ID regPath);cfg;domain;gatekeeper;body;subject
⍝ Notifies the gatekeeper(s) that a package was published.
⍝ The email as such is sent by `SendMail`.
 rc←0 ⋄ msg←''
 :If INI.Get'EMAIL:active'
 :AndIf INI.Exist'EMAIL:gatekeeper'
 :AndIf 0<≢gatekeeper←⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:gatekeeper'
     cfg←⊃##.F.NGET(regPath,ID,'\',##.Reg.CFG_Name)1
     domain←⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:Domain'
     body←cfg
     subject←'Package was published on ',domain,': ',ID
     (rc msg)←SendMail INI subject body gatekeeper
 :EndIf
⍝Done
